  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ID: Building a movement to combat the Sexual Exploitation of children on  line and in travel and tourism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to prevent the vulnerable children in three areas from 
the sexual exploitation. The strategies used in this program are include the strengthening the community based child protection which involve the parents, community, and other local stakeholders, organizing the vulnerable children, strengthening the government especially law enforcers as well as the service provider to improve their services for the child victims of sexual exploitation, strengthening the civil society and private sectors roles to combat child sexual exploitation.</narrative>
  </description>
